Topic: 🌐 Amazon Route 53 — The DNS Powerhouse of AWS ⚙️

Today’s focus is on Amazon Route 53, a highly available, scalable Domain Name System (DNS) web service that connects user requests to applications running on AWS or other infrastructures — with low latency and smart routing.

